message: 'If you wish to cite the "nokap" package use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: "multimark provides Python bindings to cmark and allows for CommonMark parsing and rendering (HTML, LaTeX, man, XML)"
version: "0.2.0"
abstract:
  multimark provides Python bindings to cmark, enabling CommonMark parsing and rendering to various formats
  including HTML, LaTeX, man, and XML. A CLI is also provided for command-line usage. The package is designed to be fast,
  efficient, and easy to use, making it a great choice for developers looking to work with CommonMark in Python.
